	(text "12V IN -> F1 3A PTC -> Q1 reverse-polarity PFET (D6 clamps Vgs) -> +12V\nD7 SMAJ15A TVS on +12V (15V standoff: off at 14.4V charging, clamps below AP62300 20V max)\nU6: +12V -> +5V  (R29/R30 52.3k/10k, L2 3.3uH)   U9: +12V -> +3.3V (R33/R34 31.6k/10k, L3 3.3uH)\nBUCK_EN: R31/R32 divider shared by U6 and U9 -> both rails start at ~9.3V\nLayout: keep each buck input loop (C35/C39 -> IN -> GND) and SW node tiny"
